Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad news, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.45,0:00:13.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do you think\Nyou're going, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:29.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know your every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei... What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:34.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:37.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:40.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's our alchemy teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:41.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Al?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.15,0:00:43.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.82,0:00:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for leading us here, when you must be so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Al is as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Alphonse...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:58.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, is that so? My, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.01,0:01:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you trying to escape by disguising yourself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:14.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stories about you two reach me quite often, my moronic pupils!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:17.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like how you broke away from my teachings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:19.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and lowered yourselves to \Nbecome dogs of the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:24.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:29.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:34.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.87,0:01:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:18.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The formal orders for your transfer have come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.56,0:03:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Starting next week,\Nyou'll be serving in Central, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:23.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to miss you here. You've been quite colorful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:31.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.\NNot as much as when you\Nwere younger, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's now or never, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here with all of your work, I was able to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have my deepest sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:45.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've lost after all, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:53.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your one victory is my parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I accept it most gratefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:56.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,General...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.35,0:04:02.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While you're giving away parting gifts,\NI have some subordinates whom\NI would like to take with me to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:05.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:06.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.57,0:04:11.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.74,0:04:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you two all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:20.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We never expected that Sensei\Nwould come for us, huh, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn...\NShe even took away\Nmy silver watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess we're going\Nstraight to Dublith.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I expected your teacher to be someone rougher, not a pretty lady like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NYou've met her before, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:43.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was in Resembool that\NSensei took us on as her pupils.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:45.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In Resembool?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember, when we had all that heavy rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:55.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ECW, 26%; ICW, 34%;\Nlipids, 19%; proteins...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:05:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:03.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be quicker if we just went with the elements composing a human body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, what have you been\Nstudying so hard about lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:11.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have anything to do with you, Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.13,0:05:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sneaks! You're always\Nkeeping secrets between you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.09,0:05:15.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're having stew\Nfor supper tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:22.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay! We'll see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoever invented stew is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:28.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's got milk in it,\Nbut it's still so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.94,0:05:34.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The idea of sticking milk into\Nvegetable soup was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:38.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scientists need to change over to that kind of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:47.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are limits to what we can do\Nstudying alone, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't make it on\Nour knowledge alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:51.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:56.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what we're missing for human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:06:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is human transmutation forbidden in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:04.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it because it's a dangerous transmutation that no one has succeeded at?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember, they say that a whole country was destroyed in one night...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:11.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The story of the Philosopher's Stone in the eastern desert, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:16.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It tells of them\Ntrying to create a complete human,\Nbut the whole population got dragged into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:20.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just a fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His formulas...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we can make sense of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...\NIt's written there that human transmutation is forbidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.55,0:06:39.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've made up my mind, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to bring\NMom back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.86,0:06:57.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sure hope the river\Ndoesn't give way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.53,0:07:02.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to go help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.55,0:07:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:22.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring more sandbags here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.55,0:07:27.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?! It's dangerous there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:32.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The transmutation circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:48.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is dangerous,\Nso please keep back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I should\Nbe saying to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:10.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!\NShe didn't even use\Na transmutation circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That huge amount of mass, all at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That should hold it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:21.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just a couple passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.74,0:08:30.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the nearest hospital?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:30.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A doctor! Get a doctor!\NHey, stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.71,0:08:40.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really saved us.\NResembool is in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:42.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, let us through.\NPardon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.59,0:08:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, Auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:51.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling your auntie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-We're sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,P-Please, take us on as pupils,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.19,0:08:59.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pupils?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're able to use a little alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:05.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We want to become\Nbetter at it, so please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:06.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.82,0:09:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't take on pupils.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:13.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have a store, so we have to be getting back to Dublith.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take us with you! Take us as pupils!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! How pesky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do learn alchemy,\Nwhat do you two want to do with it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:26.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:29.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We...\NWe want to be helpful to others!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about your parents' permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two don't have any parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:42.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who\Nlooks after them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just don't know\Nhow to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:07.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One month...\NCan I take them for\Nprovisional training?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.05,0:10:11.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To see if it's really worth teaching them alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:15.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to ascertain\Nthe talents that these children have.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if they don't have any talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll send them right back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if we pass our\Nprovisional training?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we'll proceed to\Nfull-fledged training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't be coming back in a month!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:43.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Training! Training!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there must be\Na huge laboratory there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:47.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And maybe we can\Nread lots of books!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:50.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure we can!\NIt's training, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.26,0:10:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:55.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, you performed an incredible transmutation back there
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:56.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,without even a transmutation circle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:00.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, by any chance,\Nare you a State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you lump me in with those dogs of the military,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who can calmly take\Npeople's lives if ordered to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:20.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NThat person from back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.37,0:11:21.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's make a break for it, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:31.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:38.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Looks like you still haven't learned your lesson, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:42.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.77,0:11:44.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.65,0:11:49.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard it's a style of chess from the eastern island countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:54.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes? Yes, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sure was fun\Nthe other night, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:01.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, about this weekend...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, it's okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.25,0:12:07.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, hello. I'm a little busy right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.84,0:12:12.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's got it fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:14.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:30.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by all means,\Nplease include me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:37.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you were in the Investigations Department,\Nyou served under Hughes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:40.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:54.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master Sergeant Kain Fuery,\NSecond Lieutenant Heymans Breda,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Second Lieutenant Jean Havoc,\NFirst Lieutenant Riza Hawkeye,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:01.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Warrant Officer Vato Falman—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:05.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it has been decided that these five will transfer with me to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will accept no objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:16.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We didn't get away after all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:16.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:20.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get chills just thinking about what's going to happen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.33,0:13:24.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:27.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Menny! How is Chico doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:29.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say she's about\Nto have her babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?\NThat'll liven things up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:36.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!\NMason-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Edward-kun,\Nit's been too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've really grown a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:45.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what pisses me off...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:48.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who is this in the armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er, his younger brother, Alphonse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:55.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've really grown a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.87,0:14:04.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.87,0:14:06.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.66,0:14:06.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al-kun, you eat too.\NIt's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:13.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm already full.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:19.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've had quite a brutal journey,\Nhaven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be doing such dangerous things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it hasn't been all terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've also helped people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:30.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right, we helped deliver a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silly, you call that helping? \NAll we did is get all flustered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:38.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:43.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, the family helps out as the mother risks her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.66,0:14:46.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and everyone is blessed when a person is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.24,0:14:48.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:51.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the way you guys\Nreceived life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take pride in the life you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\NIzumi-san, do you have any children?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:04.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey there, you know, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:09.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must've gotten better, right?\NShow me something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:11.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.27,0:15:14.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll come too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:21.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so? They watched a life being born, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:24.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those children had themselves a nice experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.91,0:15:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotten good, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.63,0:15:35.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:42.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, welcome home!\NWelcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, my train is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:47.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The axle broke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.52,0:15:54.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fix it with alchemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.73,0:15:58.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh. Don't rely on\Nalchemy for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fix whatever you can fix\Nby yourself on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:03.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:05.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ew, that's ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.41,0:16:10.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't want it\Nfixed so ungracefully,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.41,0:16:13.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,be more careful with it \Nso it doesn't break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.17,0:16:20.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be back when I break it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't{\i0} break it, I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:26.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Menny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.06,0:16:32.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico... It's Chico!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.99,0:16:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico's up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.49,0:16:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.67,0:17:03.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:15.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, is Chico broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.31,0:17:21.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm, no. She died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.98,0:17:25.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, fix Chico!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi-sensei, you can make anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:29.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, as far as Chico goes...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:32.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:37.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A life is different\Nfrom a thing, you see,\Nand I am not God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chico's life has ended,\Nand she isn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:43.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... up until just a while ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I cannot create a life for Chico,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:56.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can make a grave for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.73,0:18:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When something is alive,\Nthat life will expire at some point.\NThe body will return to the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where flowers will bloom on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.16,0:18:17.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their spirit will serve to nourish other people's feelings\Nand continue to live on\Ninside their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.71,0:18:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything in the world\Nflows around and circulates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People's lives are like that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.89,0:18:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though I know\Nas much about it as I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.77,0:18:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it's still so hard to make\Na child understand death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:55.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,have you ever wanted to\Nbring someone back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the second time\Nyou've asked that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:03.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was only wondering, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.09,0:19:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What does that have\Nto do with anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:12.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The basis of the transmutation circle\Nis the power of the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:14.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The circle demonstrates the circulation of power,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:19.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and through the act of drawing it,\Nthe invoking of that power becomes possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:32.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By knowing the laws and flow of power, you can contend with all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who would create things after accepting and understanding this—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:41.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they are alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:46.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world constantly follows the motion of a great current.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:49.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The death of people\Nis part of that flow,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and as such, you must not think about bringing them back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:20:00.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, that armor is empty on the inside, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.77,0:20:05.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed's arm and leg are \NAutomail as well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:05.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-How did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The weight from when I threw you...\Nyour left footsteps sounding\Ndifferent from your right ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.03,0:20:12.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you think I wouldn't notice?\NYou fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.74,0:20:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.32,0:20:17.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you did not use\Na transmutation circle, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have happened to have seen {\i1}it{\i0}, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.59,0:20:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?\NTell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei,\NI...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:41.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.94,0:20:52.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,transmuted... our mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.69,0:23:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.49,0:23:44.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 28: "One Is All, All Is One"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.53,0:23:47.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are so very small.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.58,0:23:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, we have everything in the world within us.
